            'meta_description' => 'Filing a hail damage insurance claim in Texas? What to do after the storm, how to check your roof safely, document damage and avoid scams.',
            'excerpt' => 'Hail is a fact of life across much of Texas, and a single storm can leave dents, cracked shingles, and broken windows across an entire neighborhood. What you do in the days after matters: a calm, well-documented claim tends to go far more smoothly than a…',
