            'meta_description' => 'Build a home inventory for insurance that holds up at claim time: a room-by-room checklist, photo and video tips, receipts and storage.',
            'excerpt' => 'After a fire, burglary, or burst pipe, your insurer will usually ask you to list what you lost, often item by item. Trying to remember everything in a stressful moment is hard, and whatever you forget, you generally do not get paid for. A home inventory done…',
            'topic' => 'insurance-claims',
