            'meta_description' => 'How to soundproof an apartment without damage: seal gaps, add soft surfaces, quiet shared walls and talk to neighbors. Renter-friendly fixes.',
            'excerpt' => 'You cannot rebuild the walls of a rental, but you can make a noisy apartment noticeably quieter without drills, glue, or deposit deductions. The key is understanding where sound gets in and choosing fixes that match the problem. Here is how to soundproof an…',
            'topic' => 'renting',
