            'excerpt' => 'Apartments are snug by design, which is great for heating and cooling but not so great for air. Cooking smoke, cleaning sprays, pet dander and humidity have fewer places to go, so they tend to linger. The good news is that you don\'t need to renovate to…',
            'topic' => 'lifestyle',
