            'excerpt' => 'Texas summers don\'t let up, and neither do the bills. The goal isn\'t to swelter in a hot apartment; it\'s to cut the waste so your AC works smarter instead of longer. Here\'s how to lower your electric bill in summer, whether you rent a one-bedroom in Houston…',
