            'meta_description' => 'Filing a water damage insurance claim? Sudden vs. gradual damage, your duty to mitigate, how to document and dry out, and common exclusions.',
            'excerpt' => 'Water damage is one of the most common home insurance claims, and also one of the most misunderstood. Whether it is covered often comes down to where the water came from and how quickly it happened, not how bad the damage looks. Here is how to protect your…',
